---
import Horizon from '../Horizon.astro';

const points = [
  'Tapered under medical supervision, not stopped abruptly',
  'Nursing on site around the clock through the worst of it',
  'The anxiety underneath treated at the same time',
  'No lecture about a prescription you were given in good faith',
];
---
<section id="hero" class="bg-cream">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-[60px] lg:py-[80px]">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_minmax(0,470px)] gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-gold font-body text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-6 h-px bg-gold inline-block"></span>
          Benzodiazepines · Chandler, Arizona
        </p>

        <h1 class="font-display text-navy mb-6">
          Most people did not go looking for this one.
        </h1>

        <p class="font-body text-charcoal text-[20px] leading-[33px] max-w-xl mb-8">
          Xanax, Klonopin, Ativan, Valium — a large share of the people we treat for these were handed a prescription for anxiety or sleep and took it exactly as directed. Somewhere along the way the dose stopped being enough, and stopping stopped being simple.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-9">
          {points.map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-charcoal text-[17px] leading-[29px]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-teal mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/>
              </svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="bg-white border-l-2 border-gold rounded-r-xl p-6 mb-9 max-w-xl shadow-sm">
          <p class="font-body font-semibold text-charcoal text-[17px] leading-[27px] mb-2">Please do not stop these on your own</p>
          <p class="font-body text-charcoal text-[16px] leading-[26px]">
            Benzodiazepines and alcohol are the two substances where stopping abruptly can kill you. Withdrawal can cause seizures. If you are already cutting down and feeling unwell, call us or go to an emergency room today.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href="tel:8883625576" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-teal hover:bg-teal-dark text-white font-semibold h-14 px-8 rounded-lg transition-colors font-body">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path d="M2 3a1 1 0 011-1h2.153a1 1 0 01.986.836l.74 4.435a1 1 0 01-.54 1.06l-1.548.773a11.037 11.037 0 006.105 6.105l.774-1.548a1 1 0 011.059-.54l4.435.74a1 1 0 01.836.986V17a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2C7.82 18 2 12.18 2 5V3z"/>
            </svg>
            Talk to someone now
          </a>
          <a href="/medical-detox" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-white font-semibold h-14 px-8 rounded-lg transition-colors font-body">
            See our detox programme
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-t-[160px] rounded-b-xl shadow-xl">
          <img
            src="/Asset/stock%20photo/Desktop%20Dimensions/Facility/Blue%20accent%20lounge%20with%20armchairs,%20coffee%20table,%20and%20framed%20artwork.png"
            alt="A quiet lounge with armchairs and framed artwork"
            class="w-full object-cover aspect-[4/5]"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <Horizon variant="rule" class="mt-5" />
        <p class="font-body text-muted text-[15px] leading-[24px] mt-3">
          Somewhere to come off them slowly, with people watching.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
